[31m-## 8. How SNI Extraction Works[m
[31m-[m
[31m-### The TLS Handshake[m
[31m-[m
[31m-When you visit `https://www.youtube.com`:[m
[31m-[m
[31m-```[m
[31m-┌──────────┐                              ┌──────────┐[m
[31m-│  Browser │                              │  Server  │[m
[31m-└────┬─────┘                              └────┬─────┘[m
[31m-     │                                         │[m
[31m-     │ ──── Client Hello ─────────────────────►│[m
[31m-     │      (includes SNI: www.youtube.com)    │[m
[31m-     │                                         │[m
[31m-     │ ◄─── Server Hello ───────────────────── │[m
[31m-     │      (includes certificate)             │[m
[31m-     │                                         │[m
[31m-     │ ──── Key Exchange ─────────────────────►│[m
[31m-     │                                         │[m
[31m-     │ ◄═══ Encrypted Data ══════════════════► │[m
[31m-     │      (from here on, everything is       │[m
[31m-     │       encrypted - we can't see it)      │[m
[31m-```[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**We can only extract SNI from the Client Hello!**[m
[31m-[m
[31m-### TLS Client Hello Structure[m
[31m-[m
[31m-```[m
[31m-Byte 0:     Content Type = 0x16 (Handshake)[m
[31m-Bytes 1-2:  Version = 0x0301 (TLS 1.0)[m
[31m-Bytes 3-4:  Record Length[m
[31m-[m
[31m--- Handshake Layer --[m
[31m-Byte 5:     Handshake Type = 0x01 (Client Hello)[m
[31m-Bytes 6-8:  Handshake Length[m
[31m-[m
[31m--- Client Hello Body --[m
[31m-Bytes 9-10:  Client Version[m
[31m-Bytes 11-42: Random (32 bytes)[m
[31m-Byte 43:     Session ID Length (N)[m
[31m-Bytes 44 to 44+N: Session ID[m
[31m-... Cipher Suites ...[m
[31m-... Compression Methods ...[m
[31m-[m
[31m--- Extensions --[m
[31m-Bytes X-X+1: Extensions Length[m
[31m-For each extension:[m
[31m-    Bytes: Extension Type (2)[m
[31m-    Bytes: Extension Length (2)[m
[31m-    Bytes: Extension Data[m
[31m-[m
[31m--- SNI Extension (Type 0x0000) --[m
[31m-Extension Type: 0x0000[m
[31m-Extension Length: L[m
[31m-  SNI List Length: M[m
[31m-  SNI Type: 0x00 (hostname)[m
[31m-  SNI Length: K[m
[31m-  SNI Value: "www.youtube.com" ← THE GOAL![m
[31m-```[m
[31m-[m
