[31m-## 9. How Blocking Works[m
[31m-[m
[31m-### Rule Types[m
[31m-[m
[31m-| Rule Type | Example | What it Blocks |[m
[31m-|-----------|---------|----------------|[m
[31m-| IP | `192.168.1.50` | All traffic from this source |[m
[31m-| App | `YouTube` | All YouTube connections |[m
[31m-| Domain | `tiktok` | Any SNI containing "tiktok" |[m
[31m-[m
[31m-### The Blocking Flow[m
[31m-[m
[31m-```[m
[31m-Packet arrives[m
[31m-      │[m
[31m-      ▼[m
[31m-┌─────────────────────────────────┐[m
[31m-│ Is source IP in blocked list?  │──Yes──► DROP[m
[31m-└───────────────┬─────────────────┘[m
[31m-                │No[m
[31m-                ▼[m
[31m-┌─────────────────────────────────┐[m
[31m-│ Is app type in blocked list?   │──Yes──► DROP[m
[31m-└───────────────┬─────────────────┘[m
[31m-                │No[m
[31m-                ▼[m
[31m-┌─────────────────────────────────┐[m
[31m-│ Does SNI match blocked domain? │──Yes──► DROP[m
[31m-└───────────────┬─────────────────┘[m
[31m-                │No[m
[31m-                ▼[m
[31m-            FORWARD[m
[31m-```[m
[31m-[m
[31m-### Flow-Based Blocking[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Important:** We block at the *flow* level, not packet level.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-```[m
[31m-Connection to YouTube:[m
[31m-  Packet 1 (SYN)           → No SNI yet, FORWARD[m
[31m-  Packet 2 (SYN-ACK)       → No SNI yet, FORWARD  [m
[31m-  Packet 3 (ACK)           → No SNI yet, FORWARD[m
[31m-  Packet 4 (Client Hello)  → SNI: www.youtube.com[m
[31m-                           → App: YOUTUBE (blocked!)[m
[31m-                           → Mark flow as BLOCKED[m
[31m-                           → DROP this packet[m
[31m-  Packet 5 (Data)          → Flow is BLOCKED → DROP[m
[31m-  Packet 6 (Data)          → Flow is BLOCKED → DROP[m
[31m-  ...all subsequent packets → DROP[m
[31m-```[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Why this approach?**[m
[31m-- We can't identify the app until we see the Client Hello[m
[31m-- Once identified, we block all future packets of that flow[m
[31m-- The connection will fail/timeout on the client[m
